{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Rune chaser is an Inventory management auto battler focused on deep character customization and crafting where you build your own character one body-part at a time. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Rune-crafting System</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3926720/extras/e1138c1ef72956e16725a7bf6994d755.avif?t=1763316761\" width=388 height=252 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Runes are the main currency of the game, they allow you to shape your body parts however you like.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each Rune has it's own unique effect. Finding the right combinations of runes to use on an item is key to victory.<br> </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Body Part System</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3926720/extras/2c7244789d57a04635bc0bda0c992df3.avif?t=1763316761\" width=386 height=366 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your character is composed of 4 types of body parts: Core, Arms, Visages and Coils.<br>Each body part archetype comes with unique pool of crafted modifiers.\u00a0 \u00a0</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><br> Trifecta Magic System</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3926720/extras/0c6c0d6db037cc4db383b1a7d1d99edc.avif?t=1763316761\" width=1126 height=528 /></span>Arms are the main means of dealing damage, they use 3 types of magic: Water, Lightning and Cold.\u00a0<br>Each magic school has its own set of mechanics and modifiers. They all synergize with each other.\u00a0</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3926720?t=1763316761","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3926720/bad0db22984b477c494d1fafa2a874e1d8dcc3c1/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1763316761","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3926720/ec3f4b6f757f993a8153054ec9ca82f575952af0/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1763316761","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3926720/ec3f4b6f757f993a8153054ec9ca82f575952af0/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1763316761","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[5],"notes":"The game features existential and philosophical themes. It also features a fair bit of corpses and decay, although not for shock value but for narrative meaning. It's similar to how Dark Souls handles those types of elements."},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Rune chaser is an Inventory management auto battler focused on deep character customization and crafting where you build your own character one body-part at a time. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Rune-crafting System</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3926720/extras/e1138c1ef72956e16725a7bf6994d755.avif?t=1763316761\" width=388 height=252 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Runes are the main currency of the game, they allow you to shape your body parts however you like.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each Rune has it's own unique effect. Finding the right combinations of runes to use on an item is key to victory.<br> </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Body Part System</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3926720/extras/2c7244789d57a04635bc0bda0c992df3.avif?t=1763316761\" width=386 height=366 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your character is composed of 4 types of body parts: Core, Arms, Visages and Coils.<br>Each body part archetype comes with unique pool of crafted modifiers.\u00a0 \u00a0</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><br> Trifecta Magic System</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3926720/extras/0c6c0d6db037cc4db383b1a7d1d99edc.avif?t=1763316761\" width=1126 height=528 /></span>Arms are the main means of dealing damage, they use 3 types of magic: Water, Lightning and Cold.\u00a0<br>Each magic school has its own set of mechanics and modifiers. They all synergize with each other.\u00a0</p>","developers":["theRunecrafter"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3926720/ffc646e3b227e43e2956949081f12d5039400096/header.jpg?t=1763316761","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3926720/234709354/683ee0bc238b37b38c69c633c246b1182dea808a/1758408402/dash_av1.mpd?t=1759133352","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3926720/234709354/683ee0bc238b37b38c69c633c246b1182dea808a/1758408402/dash_h264.mpd?t=1759133352","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3926720/234709354/683ee0bc238b37b38c69c633c246b1182dea808a/1758408402/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1759133352","id":257202975,"name":"Rune Chaser Gameplay","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257202975/8f5b77a8dc41cc76b7337cee88b2d83326c7cff6/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1759133352"}],"name":"Rune Chaser","package_groups":[],"pc_requireme